menu_counter=\"23\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> boxes.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the diagram is the following:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-92772-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-92772-a-1\"></div>      <div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-92772-a-5\">      </div></div>",
